{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Turret is a factory-building solo-tower-defense game with a large amount of crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You construct large conveyor networks, craft complex bullet recipes, and keep your One Turret supplied as you fight back waves of the robot army. Play on various maps with different materials and bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assembly Lines!!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smelt or Refine items to create brand new ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items to craft powerful bullets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the crafting hint to help figure out new combinations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map Builder to create and share your own maps!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding support for custom bullets, enemies, and buildings  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Index, a built-in wiki and crafting guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive the mechanical remains of your foes... and maybe have a friendly chat?!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958160?t=1764560688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958160?t=1764560688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958160/e969e787272620b35b8619eb16cf2d21f7f1b136/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764560688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958160/e969e787272620b35b8619eb16cf2d21f7f1b136/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764560688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Turret is a factory-building solo-tower-defense game with a large amount of crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You construct large conveyor networks, craft complex bullet recipes, and keep your One Turret supplied as you fight back waves of the robot army. Play on various maps with different materials and bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assembly Lines!!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smelt or Refine items to create brand new ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items to craft powerful bullets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the crafting hint to help figure out new combinations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map Builder to create and share your own maps!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding support for custom bullets, enemies, and buildings  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Index, a built-in wiki and crafting guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive the mechanical remains of your foes... and maybe have a friendly chat?!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kaplin86"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958160/71b3c905dc813119e3a88ec4900c2953545e52e5/header.jpg?t=1764560688","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"One Turret","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with Vulkan 1.0 support or OpenGL 3.3 compatible<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"pub